flowchart LR
  OSM[Public OpenStreetMap network] --> PIPE[CLI geospatial pipeline]
  CENSUS[Census land boundaries] --> PIPE
  PIPE --> DB[(PostgreSQL + PostGIS)]
  DB --> API[FastAPI read API]
  API --> UI[React decision workspace]
  UI --> MAP[MapLibre H3 exploration]
  UI --> PLOT[Plotly comparisons and quality]
  PREVIEW[Temporary scoring preview] --> API
  SCORING[Pure normalization and scoring] --> PIPE
  SCORING --> API
  SEED[Seeded synthetic generator] --> SIM[CLI simulate-area]
  DB --> SIM
  SIM --> SYN[(Synthetic scenario tables)]
  SYN --> API
  API --> OPS[Operations page: synthetic label]
